# registry_provider_docs (Data Source)

Fetches the markdown documentation for a specific resource, data source, or guide from a Terraform provider. Useful for building documentation aggregation tools or including provider docs in your own systems.

## Example Usage

{{ tffile "examples/data-sources/registry_provider_docs/main.tf" }}

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Document Types

The `doc_type` attribute accepts:
- `resources` - Resource documentation (e.g., `aws_instance`)
- `data-sources` - Data source documentation (e.g., `aws_ami`)
- `guides` - Guide documentation
